  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Saturday I remember as a day of suspense, hot and close and still.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 5.34
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The milkman said they were surrounded in the night, and that guns were coming up.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 8.0,
      "seconds": 5.22
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A pity they are so unapproachable, said my neighbour; we might learn something.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 15.458,
      "seconds": 5.08
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A second had come down by the golf links, and the woods still burned.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 22.75,
      "seconds": 4.76
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "After breakfast I walked down, and got no further than the bridge.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 29.917,
      "seconds": 4.42
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "snippy",
      "text": "What's cover against this heat? The sticks would cook you.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 36.75,
      "seconds": 4.22
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Nobody was allowed over the canal. None of these men had seen a Martian.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 43.375,
      "seconds": 4.67
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I told them what I had seen, and they fell to arguing.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 50.25,
      "seconds": 3.59
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "snippy",
      "text": "Octopuses. Talk about fishers of men. Fighters of fish it is this time.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 56.25,
      "seconds": 5.39
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "All afternoon they showed not an inch of themselves.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 64.042,
      "seconds": 3.62
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "We signalled with a flag on a pole. They took no notice.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 70.083,
      "seconds": 4.28
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "All that armament excited me. They seemed very helpless down there.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 76.583,
      "seconds": 5.04
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "At six we sat at tea on the lawn, talking about the battle coming.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 84.042,
      "seconds": 5.34
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A muffled detonation, a gust of firing, and a crash that shook the ground.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 91.583,
      "seconds": 5.48
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The college was down. Our own crest was in range now.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 99.5,
      "seconds": 3.68
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "We can't possibly stay here.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 107.792,
      "seconds": 2.43
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "narrators_wife",
      "text": "But where are we to go?",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 114.25,
      "seconds": 1.96
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Leatherhead, I shouted: her cousins' town, twelve miles off and out of this.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 118.625,
      "seconds": 5.06
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The landlord wanted a pound for his horse and cart.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 126.125,
      "seconds": 3.87
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I gave him two, and promised to bring it back by midnight.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 132.208,
      "seconds": 3.89
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I packed our plate in a tablecloth. The palings glowed red.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 138.333,
      "seconds": 4.94
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_hussar",
      "text": "Crawling out in a thing like a dish cover!",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 146.208,
      "seconds": 3.28
    }
  ],
  "plan": "7147a37d0bf47af0"
}